{"synopsis":"Saya Hwapyung.\n\nSeorang pria yang ingin hidup normal seperti namanya.\n\nSemua yang dia miliki dalam kehidupan duniawinya hancur.\n\n[Cintamu telah menjadi kebencianku.]\n\nSeharusnya kau tidak main-main denganku sejak awal.\n\nAnda seharusnya membiarkan saya menjalani kehidupan yang tenang.\n\nDan sekarang dia telah memulai langkahnya agar tidak ada musuh bebuyutannya yang akan selamat dari amarahnya.","alternative_title":"The Invincible Man","author":"Cyungchan Noh","artist":"], Hwi [Add","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ddfb00d4-5879-49d7-be3d-8d2b5f028aa0","number":"103","chapter":"103","title":"","date":"2025-12-12","released":"2025-12-12"},{"chapter_id":"42f880e9-49df-4661-a562-3a47b25fd0f1","number":"102","chapter":"102","title":"","date":"2025-12-12","released":"2025-12-12"},{"chapter_id":"0387bc87-5063-4963-a9b9-c9164ee878e6","number":"101","chapter":"101","title":"","date":"2025-12-12","released":"2025-12-12"},{"chapter_id":"dc1586aa-5146-4d8b-bf86-a10477852451","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2025-12-07","released":"2025-12-07"},{"chapter_id":"147b0661-d003-4e23-b6c7-22f155e074e7","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"","date":"2025-12-07","released":"2025-12-07"},{"chapter_id":"5f9a52ba-ebb7-420b-89ad-6c8c7ea168a2","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"","date":"2025-12-07","released":"2025-12-07"},{"chapter_id":"5a8f7eb1-7b0f-4bfb-94f6-43918134d08f","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2025-11-29","released":"2025-11-29"},{"chapter_id":"c94628d3-b62c-49ac-aa13-c33180c2af3c","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2025-11-29","released":"2025-11-29"},{"chapter_id":"313bb0da-d604-4573-b33d-5d3ce8253bf6","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2025-11-12","released":"2025-11-12"},{"chapter_id":"bb2f39d6-71b9-4abb-a60c-de1f69019ddc","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2025-11-12","released":"2025-11-12"},{"chapter_id":"cf9033a0-9168-4a85-a18b-8c3f0860376b","number":"93","chapter":"93","title"